The install uses python3.12 -m venv, not python3: on macOS python3 is often the system 3.9, which pip refuses for this package (requires-python >= 3.11, for tomllib), and the error only shows up after the venv is made. The user install is plain '.', with '.[dev]' only under Development, so new users don't pull in pytest. Every command in the README was run on a fresh clone of this branch before committing.
